{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "weno5_eno1_cosine_mask",
    "description": "Pointwise cosine blending mask of NCAR fire_behavior's fire_upwinding = 10 (physics/level_set_mod.F90 Calc_tend_ls case 10), the weight of the WENO5 derivative in the blend of stencils/weno5_eno1_masked_blend. With a = |u[i,j]| the cell's distance from the front and b the band half-width (threshold_hlu = weno_band_cells dx in the reference, where band_width = 2 b and transition_width = b), the mask is the reference's three branches written as they are: 1 for a <= b (inside the band: pure WENO5), 0.5 (1 + cos(p (a - b) / b)) for b < a <= 2 b (the transition: a cosine taper from 1 to 0), and 0 for a > 2 b (outside: pure ENO1). The two ends are therefore EXACTLY 1 and 0 whatever p is -- in particular with fire_behavior's truncated PI = 3.1415926, for which the taper itself only reaches 0.5 (1 + cos(3.1415926)) = 7e-16 at a = 2 b, as it does in the reference. The taper spells the reference's own operation order, PI * (a - (band_width - transition_width)) / transition_width, with band_width - transition_width = 2 b - b = b exactly in floating point. p is pi, bound by the caller (the blend stencils bind the free name pi_blend) so the consumer supplies the value its own constants use. Params: a (>= 0), b (> 0), p.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:selector",
      "axes:x,y",
      "stencil_width:1"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls case (10) (band_width = 2 threshold_hlu, transition_width = threshold_hlu, the three-branch cosine mask and the `if (mask > 0.0)` blend), Select_eno, Select_weno5, Select_4th, Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [],
  "expression_templates": {
    "weno5_eno1_cosine_mask": {
      "params": [
        "a",
        "b",
        "p"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "<=",
            "args": [
              "a",
              "b"
            ]
          },
          1.0,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "<=",
                "args": [
                  "a",
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      2,
                      "b"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  0.5,
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      1.0,
                      {
                        "op": "cos",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  "p",
                                  {
                                    "op": "-",
                                    "args": [
                                      "a",
                                      "b"
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              "b"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              0.0
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
